   249	
   250	        Raises:
   251	            ValueError: ``prefix`` is negative.
   252	            atoms.OrderingError: The selected facts cannot be ordered under
   253	                ``key`` — mixed key types, or sort-key elements (key value or
   254	                tie-break id) that do not compare.
   255	                It propagates: a declaration error against the data is a
   256	                refusal to surface, not something to coerce past.
