    54	#: The ordering a vector is read under when it declares none. Vectors in this
    55	#: family omit `input.ordering` entirely — that omission is what keeps the
    56	#: pre-existing normative files byte-identical.
    57	DEFAULT_ORDERING = ByKey("ts")
    58	
    59	
    60	#: Resolve a declared lens key against a combined-read record: `ts` and `id`
    61	#: are envelope attributes, every other key a flat payload field. The rule
    62	#: lives in atoms — the runner and `StoreReader.ordered` bind the same
    63	#: function, so there is nothing left to drift.
    64	lens_get_field = resolve_key_field
