    73	        A one-member aggregate's page still comes off the (ts, id) lens here —
    74	        unlike the fold, which member-counts — so serving a declared Arrival()
    75	        would be a lie. It refuses instead. The divergence between the two
    76	        surfaces predates this cut; only the refusal is new.
