   403	    """The expected block for one case, from the combined read's records.
   404	
   405	    The default `ByKey("ts")` family keeps `vertex_facts` as its oracle — those
   406	    vectors are frozen normative artifacts and their order must not start
   407	    depending on a different code path. `totalize` is asserted to AGREE with
   408	    it, which is how the family is pinned "via the atoms primitive" without
   409	    swapping the oracle underneath the frozen files. A disagreement is a
   410	    finding, so it fails the regeneration loudly rather than rewriting bytes.
   411	    """
